  "albumInformation": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; line-height: 13.05pt;\">The IMG is a rock band from the Republic of Karelia (from North of Russia) formed in 2012. The music of \"The IMG\" mixes elements from different genres like indie, psychedelic rock, folk and many others. The band consists of university friends Yuri Suetin (lead vocals, guitar), Tim Romance (bass guitar), Nikita Litvinov (drums), Andrey Prusski (lead guitar), and Alexei Grigorchuk (violin, piano, keyboards). </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; line-height: 13.05pt;\">The IMG has just released their first album called Kaleidoscope.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"> <br /></span></p>",
